⚠️ Common Mistakes

❌ Trying to modify final variables
❌ Overriding final methods
❌ Using `==` instead of `equals()` for objects

---

🧠 Real Insight

👉 `final` is widely used in:

* Constants
* Immutable classes
* Secure APIs

👉 Object class methods are used in:

* Collections
* Debugging
* Frameworks

----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

📚 Key Takeaways

✔ `final` restricts modification
✔ final variable → constant
✔ final method → cannot override
✔ final class → cannot inherit
✔ Object class is parent of all classes

